window.products.push({"id":582290,"name":"Color Mode Real Flame on White Pillar Candle - Set of 3 - Green - Not LED - Must See!!! Aurora Green, 5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yAETnV3rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Colored Flamed Collection Candles are created using 100% natural ingredients. The candles are non-toxic, bio-degradable and derived from renewable resources. Our Romantic Red flame candle is set on a classic white pillar of wax. It produces a breathtaking reddish-pink flame. The radiance of this red flame can create a romantic or festive vibe. The rosy glow produced by a red flame makes a low-intensity light, perfect for any setting. INGREDIENTS: Trimethyl Citrate (ester of citric acid and used as a food additive), Syzygium aromaticum (clove oil), Palm Stearin (solid fraction of palm oil). Naturally occurring salts are added to create the brilliant colored flame. HOW TO USE: Keep the wax free of matches, wick trimmings, or other flammable materials. Due to the candle's unique wax composition, it is normal for the candle to have irregularities in the surface coloration and texture of the wax. Abrasions and hairline fractures are also normal and will not affect the performance or burning of the candle. Please note- THIS CANDLE WILL DRIP. Make certain that the candle is securely placed in or on a heat-safe dish or surface. Keep out of the reach of children and pets. Keep away from flammable materials and drafts. Never leave a burning candle unattended. Never move a candle while lit or the wax is hot. Failure to comply with these warnings and instructions may result in serious injury or fire hazard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yAETnV3rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Color Mode","source_asin":"B0BNF8S6QT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNF8S6QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNF8S6QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
