window.products.push({"id":582518,"name":"mDesign Hanging Metal Shower Caddy - Bottle Organizer Shelf with Hooks for Shower, Bath - Hanging Shower Caddy Rack for Shampoo, Conditioner - Shower ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612xA6Z2f0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display all of your shower essentials with this Slanted Shower Caddy by mDesign. This modern holder rack features six slanted shelves for bottles, two base baskets, two front hooks, and two hooks on each side to hold everything in one convenient place. This caddy rack has a non-slip grip and a suction cup that lets you easily hang over your shower head for hassle-free installation and stay in place - don't worry about it slipping, sliding, or spilling items. The durable metal wire design keeps water flowing away and lets items dry completely and quickly between showers. Enjoy a soothing spa-quality experience in the comfort of your own home with this minimalistic caddy. mDesign - Solutions for Home. Solutions for Life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612xA6Z2f0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B0BCHFG2HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCHFG2HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCHFG2HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":582519,"name":"Windowsandgarden Cordless Roller Shades 32W x 72H, Splendor Blackout White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/216VzbbFz7L._AC_.jpg","description":"These roller shades come have both Light filtering and blackouts options. The blackouts are perfect to help keep your bedroom dark during the bright early summer days. Light Filtering shades let some light in but still give you privacy. For the Light Filtering shades, the lighter colors will let more light in and the darker colors will b;ock more light. All these roller shades are completely private. We can customize these blackout roller shades up to an 1/8th of an inch. Once you click your size you will see a \"Customize Now\" button on the top right. You then type inside the window frame mount or outside the window frame mount and you exact measurements to the 1/8th of an inch. You will also see 3 lift options under the customization options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/216VzbbFz7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windowsandgarden","source_asin":"B00NG9QDSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NG9QDSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NG9QDSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
