window.products.push({"id":582553,"name":"Vegetable Chopper, Onion Chopper, 13 Pieces with 7 Interchangeable Stainless Steel Blades and Peeler, for Fruits Cheese and Onions (Cleaning Brush inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61875s-8kiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The TechPlus onion chopper is your good kitchen helper. With this multifunctional kitchen machine, fruits and vegetables can be cut into cubes, strips, pieces and slices easily. It will shorten the preparation time of cooking and help you to get rid of countless kitchen tools (knives, bowls, cutting boards, etc.) which can’t always at hand and need plenty of storage space. Attention: 1.Before you insert the blade to use, make sure to wash the rounded narrow sides of the blade. 2.In order to extend the use-life, it is better careful to use, don’t beat with sound. 3.The blade is sharp, please place it in the place out of reach of children. Tips: 1.Immerse the machine into the water before using. Wet blade cuts faster and costs less power, the vegetables can kept moist when cutting. 2.Keep the peel of fruits and vegetables, always let the peel facing up on the blade to save you power. 3.To ensure a smooth cutting, the fruits and vegetables should be smaller than the diameter of blade. 10pcs set includes: 1 vegetable chopper with container（2000ml） 1 cover for holding a fresh collection container 1 safety holder & 1 peeler 1 cleaning fork 1 eggs cutter (2 shapes) 1 vegetable grater 1 slicer &1 corrugated slicer 1 chunks cutter and pieces cutter * one cleaning brush as gift* The vegetable chopper comes with an acticarbon bag（the green one）for more fresh smell in package, please do not eat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61875s-8kiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TechPlus","source_asin":"B07DCM4KK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DCM4KK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DCM4KK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
