window.products.push({"id":582700,"name":"AVLA 4 Pack Porcelain Soup Bowl, 18 Ounce Ceramic Soup Crock with Handles, Stackable Serving Bowls for Cereal, Stew, Chill, Beef Stew, Pot Pies, Indiv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CRRNLcewL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Size: Package included set of 4 porcelain soup bowl, each bowl measures 6.5 ( L ) x 4.5 ( W ) x 2.5 ( H ) inch ( Include Double Handle ), hold approx 18 ounces fluid ( Limit Capacity ). A great set for the family to enjoy cereal, french onion soup, stew, chili, and many more of your favorite delicious meals. Grade Ceramic Material: AVLA ceramic soup bowls sets are made of high quality ceramic, lead-free, non-toxic, chip-resistant and durable. Compared to plastic or stainless steel one, ceramic is free of heavy metals and doesn't absorb food odors or flavors. Two Sturdy Handle: Double Handles Soup Bowls, have 2 great sturdy handles to balance the heaviness. The handle does not get hot and its' durable. The handles make serving these bowls to others easier, one for you to extend and one for them to grab onto. Easy to Stack and Use: Porcelain french onion soup bowls design makes them easily to handle and hold and they stack really well without taking up much space. Each bowl can confidently be used in the freezer, oven, microwave and dishwasher. Wide Application: Thick wall design makes the surprisingly versatile soup bowl your ideal bakeware and serveware. Not only perfect for everyday use and family parties, but also a great gift choice for housewarming, wedding party, mother's day, father's day, Christmas and other festival.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CRRNLcewL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVLA","source_asin":"B09LYHN7L4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYHN7L4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYHN7L4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
