window.products.push({"id":582822,"name":"Appetizer Tray By ADORN, 8-Section Appetizers-on-Ice Platter Dish with Lids plus Dip Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ap0EdfvLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keep your appetizers fresh and cold: The ice-chilled sectional appetizer tray with dip cup and lids by Adorn Home Essentials is the most convenient way to keep your fruit, veggies, cold cuts, seafood, sushi, condiments, dips, dressings etc. Chilled for your party or picnic and also protected from insects and bugs without the need for a food tent. Simply fill the bottom with ice or fill it up with water and freeze it and keep your food fresh and cool for hours. Simple but bold design with lift Rim. The tray is designed with simple lines and clean edges to blend in with any themed table setting. Crystal clear. Wavy rim around the tray doubles as a carrying handle. 4 dual-compartment cups tthis appetizers-on-ice serving tray is big enough for even large parties the tray itself is one open bowl (for ice) and 4 double-section compartments, with 4 lids, slide in to form a sectional tray of 8 compartments. In addition, the center features a circular dipping cup with lid. Well vented: Each compartment has vents in the bottom to the allow the iced cool air to rise through from the bottom, keeping your food chilled, fresh and tasty. 5 independent lids: The individual lids help trap more of the cool air in the tray, keeping it cold for as long as possible, plus bug protection. Durable: Made from strong and durable crystal-clear food-grade plastic. Fully approved and BPA free. All that is left for you to do is focus on socializing and enjoying your party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ap0EdfvLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adorn Home Essentials","source_asin":"B01GVTP7AG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GVTP7AG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GVTP7AG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
