window.products.push({"id":582848,"name":"Lavish Touch Queen Size Luxury Fitted Sheet-1250 TC Cotton Sheets Triblend -Fade Resistant- Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yIg9OxlGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1250 TC Easy Care Fitted Sheet - Our durable 1250 thread count cotton fitted sheets are of perfect weight, regulate body temperature, environmentally sustainable, and get softer after every wash. Queen Fitted Sheet - Our queen fitted sheet consists of 1 fitted sheet measuring 60\" x 80\". Our 54% cotton, 40% polyester, and 6% modal fabric is a lightweight, breathable blend of cotton, polyester, and modal make these fitted sheets perfect for year-round use. To provide more resilience with a smooth soft feeling feel and lustrous appearance. Warm and cozy in the winter, and comfortably cool in the summer. 16\" Deep Pocket Fit - They fit mattresses up to around 16\" deep pockets can fit on the large mattress as well. Double-needle stitch makes it more durable, soft and smooth and fade resistant, and are very easy to maintain. Broad all-over stitched elastic inside the fitted sheet makes it snug tightly to the mattress. Deep-pocket fitted sheet with elastic all around ensures that sheets stay on bed tightly. Wash Instructions - Machine wash in cold water only. Do not bleach. Tumble dry on low heat. Remove immediately after spinning. Press with a warm iron if needed. Gets softer with each wash, chemical-free that is safe for you, your family, and the environment. Our fitted sheets are the most affordable sheets you'll ever find. The comfort of these fitted sheets will have you coming back! Made in OEKO-TEX certified facility - An independent certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards and are tested for harmful substances. We provide exceptional customer service; Make your guests and loved ones feel relaxed with this fitted sheet. They are perfect for your space, and you can decorate it in your bedroom, guest room, kids room, vacation home with different colors available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yIg9OxlGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavish Touch","source_asin":"B09KR3BJ8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KR3BJ8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KR3BJ8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
