window.products.push({"id":582998,"name":"panergy 8-inch Table Fan with Remote, USB Desk Fan, Portable Desktop Air Circulator with RGB Mood Light, 3 Speeds & 3 Timers Settings, 360° Rotatable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716tzIgS1-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DUAL CONTROL MODE】You can control the fan from as far as 16 ft. away with the included remote, or simply by pressing the buttons on the back of the head. (Tip: Take out the insulation sheet on the back of the remote to ensure normal use).There is a groove at the base where you could store the remote or little items, keeping things organized. 【USB POWERED & 3 TIMERS】Carrying no battery, this table fan is USB powered, which supports multiple power supply, like computer, laptop, power bank, or any USB-enabled devices. The power cord is 5 ft., long enough for your indoor use. It has 3 timers that you can set at 1/3/5 hours, customizing your own time as needed. 【RGB MOOD LIGHT】With uniquely-designed RGB light which has 3 adjustable light modes and 5 brightness settings, you can choose the light to be solid red, white, green, yellow, purple, blue, cyan, or automatically change colors gradually or breathingly, creating a romantic mood for your night or provide the light you need when getting up at night. 【360° POWERFUL AIR CIRCULATION】Equipped with a brushless motor, this quiet fan can produce up to 11.8 ft./s airflow to provide comfortable cooling in a small and medium-sized room. 3 optional speeds and 360° pivoting head will suit your needs for different occasions. 【COMPACT & PORTABLE】The 8 inch desktop fan weighs only 1.3 lb. The compact size fits any room corner or table top without taking up much space. A great air circulator fan to keep you cool all day long no matter you are at home, office, dorm, RV, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716tzIgS1-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"panergy","source_asin":"B0BJQ8N3RJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJQ8N3RJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJQ8N3RJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
